{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CyberSushi is an adrenaline-fueled arcade roguelite starring a roster of cute cybernetic sushi heroes racing through collapsing dimensions. Chain streaks to ignite WASABI Overdrive, fill your Sushi Surge meter to unleash  Sushi Hacks, and escape into loops that keep pulling you back into faster, stranger, and more absurd worlds where sushi was never meant to roll.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What you\u2019ll do</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chain streaks</strong> \u2013 Collect tokens, extend your combo, and keep the run alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ignite WASABI Overdrive</strong> \u2013 Build your streak to trigger short score multipliers and accelerate filling your Surge meter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash Sushi Hacks</strong> \u2013 Fill your Sushi Surge meter, choose a Sushi Hack, and stack them into builds so over-the-top they feel illegal in most dimensions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equip loadouts</strong> \u2013 Select powerups before each run to customize your starting strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock and level up heroes</strong> \u2013 Collect new CyberSushi characters, level them up, and ascend their star ranks to strengthen unique buffs and deepen roster progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive infinite loops</strong> \u2013 Dimensions collapse, reality fractures, and yet the run never ends. Each loop reshapes the world into something faster, stranger, and more absurd \u2014 a sushi spiral that refuses to end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Energy Orbs</strong> \u2013 Smash glowing orbs to trigger a Chaos Spin that unlocks random powerups able to flip a run in an instant.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore pocket dimensions</strong> \u2013 Discover unstable portals mid-run that warp you into absurd bonus realms stuffed with rewards, weird hazards, and sushi secrets best left unexplained.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chase replayability</strong> \u2013 Dive into daily challenges and keep runs fresh with seasonal content updates.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, stylish, and ridiculous, CyberSushi blends the instant fun of arcade runners with the long-term replayability of roguelites. It\u2019s easy to pick up, impossible to put down, and always dares you to go for one more run\u00a0\u2014 even when common sense says you should put the controller down.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3912720?t=1773268391","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912720/061fe7b1d8fae631fd9dd6cb7a944bd54c4ba0f5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773268391","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912720/8573da2d2f9dc5c63843674f519695c24560034c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773268391","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912720/8573da2d2f9dc5c63843674f519695c24560034c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773268391","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CyberSushi is an adrenaline-fueled arcade roguelite starring a roster of cute cybernetic sushi heroes racing through collapsing dimensions. Chain streaks to ignite WASABI Overdrive, fill your Sushi Surge meter to unleash  Sushi Hacks, and escape into loops that keep pulling you back into faster, stranger, and more absurd worlds where sushi was never meant to roll.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What you\u2019ll do</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chain streaks</strong> \u2013 Collect tokens, extend your combo, and keep the run alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ignite WASABI Overdrive</strong> \u2013 Build your streak to trigger short score multipliers and accelerate filling your Surge meter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash Sushi Hacks</strong> \u2013 Fill your Sushi Surge meter, choose a Sushi Hack, and stack them into builds so over-the-top they feel illegal in most dimensions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equip loadouts</strong> \u2013 Select powerups before each run to customize your starting strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock and level up heroes</strong> \u2013 Collect new CyberSushi characters, level them up, and ascend their star ranks to strengthen unique buffs and deepen roster progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive infinite loops</strong> \u2013 Dimensions collapse, reality fractures, and yet the run never ends. Each loop reshapes the world into something faster, stranger, and more absurd \u2014 a sushi spiral that refuses to end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Energy Orbs</strong> \u2013 Smash glowing orbs to trigger a Chaos Spin that unlocks random powerups able to flip a run in an instant.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore pocket dimensions</strong> \u2013 Discover unstable portals mid-run that warp you into absurd bonus realms stuffed with rewards, weird hazards, and sushi secrets best left unexplained.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chase replayability</strong> \u2013 Dive into daily challenges and keep runs fresh with seasonal content updates.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, stylish, and ridiculous, CyberSushi blends the instant fun of arcade runners with the long-term replayability of roguelites. It\u2019s easy to pick up, impossible to put down, and always dares you to go for one more run\u00a0\u2014 even when common sense says you should put the controller down.</p>","developers":["Ezza Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912720/e6b1414447abaacf5c1c2bdd9d4897540176df84/header.jpg?t=1773268391","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Ezza Games Pty Ltd. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3912720/686959951/63be9bcaa8e40b30032a79b372c6c623012d7d54/1759290490/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759292061","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3912720/686959951/63be9bcaa8e40b30032a79b372c6c623012d7d54/1759290490/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759292061","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3912720/686959951/63be9bcaa8e40b30032a79b372c6c623012d7d54/1759290490/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759292061","id":257209797,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257209797/e036aa1ebd16347010ba06998e9db1b64f8a32d6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759292061"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3912720/1030258787/524ecd7009caeff7c27e8e07232a600f711a695c/1758709185/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758726011","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3912720/1030258787/524ecd7009caeff7c27e8e07232a600f711a695c/1758709185/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758726011","highlight":true,"hls_h2